# The config-apply helper's runtime directory. It must exist before
# mhvtl-control.service starts: the daemon unit masks it with InaccessiblePaths=,
# which fails the start when the path is missing. See tmpfiles.d(5):
# https://www.freedesktop.org/software/systemd/man/latest/tmpfiles.d.html
d /run/mhvtl-control-apply 0700 root root -
